{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Code Cards 是一款把會員卡、圖書證及各類條碼卡集中收納的錢包 App，適合不想隨身攜帶一堆實體卡片的用戶。卡片資料儲存在裝置本機，無需註冊帳戶，亦不會自動上傳到任何地方。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-120.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>掃描匯入條碼一目瞭然</h2>\n<p>以相機掃描條碼或 QR 碼，也可從相片、截圖匯入或手動輸入卡號，並保留開頭的零，避免號碼出錯。錢包支援按卡名搜尋、標記常用卡片，配合資料夾分類整理，結帳時以全螢幕顯示條碼，方便店員掃讀。免費版可加入 3 張卡片，足以應付日常所需。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-358-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-359-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-360-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-361-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-362-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-363-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Code Cards: Loyalty Wallet</li><li>應用類別：Shopping</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/code-cards-loyalty-wallet/id6790402940?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T05:41:45.422780+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":300,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T05:25:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T17:18:09.986342+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T05:38:33.786740+00:00","content_hash":"b6fc6dd94b625df46c5c975cc8e6488cf7dc141b6c154c7e27e81a8aa280ecc8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T05:41:45.422780+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}